Scope. This licence covers the source code of Open Business Case Bench (the
files under src/, tests/, and the documentation). It does NOT cover:

  - The business case materials fetched into data/jbca_pairs/. Those are
    third-party works whose authors retain copyright; they are used under the
    AABRI open-access reader grant and are not redistributed by this repository.
    See docs/licence.md.

  - Third-party dependencies, which carry their own licences. Note in particular
    that the default PDF extractor, pymupdf4llm, is AGPL-3.0. Using it does not
    change the licence of this code, but if you distribute or offer this software
    as a network service, the AGPL's terms apply to that component. The MIT-
    licensed `docling` extractor is a permissive alternative
    (OBCB_EXTRACTOR=docling).
